  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Gender Equality with Church Partners - CAFOD Internal Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This approval is for CAFOD&apos;s Internal Grant to support:  

1, Gender Audit for 4 Partners:( 2 partners in Zambia - Caritas Zambia and Caritas Lusaka and 2 partners in Zimbabwe - Caritas Zimbabwe and Caritas Gweru)
2,Partners&apos; Learning visit to Malawi
3,End of Programme Evaluation
4,Partner support visits
5,Vehicle running costs
Project Goal : Reduction of gender disparities in parishes of participating partners (caritas Zambia, Caritas Lusaka, Caritas Zimbabwe and Caritas Gweru) through increased ownership of church leaders and capacity of church partners in promoting gender equality.
Outcomes:
1. Gender audit of Caritas Zambia, Caritas Lusaka, Caritas Zimbabwe and Caritas Gweru: documentation of the audit results and recommendations
2. Improved capacity and learning amongst the programme partners.
3. End of Programme Evaluation</narrative>
  </description>
